<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Applied Materials boosted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Applied Materials boosted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch analyst Robert Stern said he raised his near-term, or in the brokerage's parlance, intermediate rating on Applied Materials Inc to accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Stern declined to comment immediately on any change he may have made in his target price for the stock or in earnings estimates.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
